    "rationale": "Differentiated paired limbs, open raptorial armature, compound paddles and twelve separate trunk plates justify a practical medium/high-detail low-poly budget. Spend geometry on diagnostic profiles and limb separation, not dense micro-scales. Ceilings are fixed, not fill targets."
